00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.270
will be coming in by Zoom,

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.212
is an associate professor
at the National Institute

00:07:42.212 --> 00:07:46.590
Advanced Studies in Bangalore,
India, also an IPCC author.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:51.330
And her work has been looking
at equity within the general

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.740
enterprise of climate modeling.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:55.110
So I think we've got a great panel

