to quickly summarize

00:52:14.610 --> 00:52:17.190
and take a poll of the panelists

00:52:17.190 --> 00:52:19.325
on whether we're on the right track

00:52:19.325 --> 00:52:22.560
in terms of an agenda for
being able to do this better.

00:52:22.560 --> 00:52:26.910
If there are two buckets,
one is something to do

00:52:26.910 --> 00:52:29.820
with generating greater

00:52:29.820 --> 00:52:34.020
and more influential pull
for effective integration,

00:52:34.020 --> 00:52:37.863
recognizing that that pull must be,

00:52:38.820 --> 00:52:42.510
or that agenda setting must
be more equitable than it has

00:52:42.510 --> 00:52:45.060
been in the past and may
ask different questions,

00:52:45.060 --> 00:52:48.990
may pose different challenges
for integrated models.

00:52:48.990 --> 00:52:51.900
So some intervention on the pull side,

00:52:51.900 --> 00:52:54.520
hoping that the pull

00:52:56.323 --> 00:52:57.156
helps grow

00:52:58.830 --> 00:53:01.140
efforts to overcome frictions,

00:53:01.140 --> 00:53:03.790
inspires early career researchers

00:53:05.085 --> 00:53:07.410
and perhaps highlights some of the,

00:53:07.410 --> 00:53:08.700
we don't have a good answer yet on

00:53:08.700 --> 00:53:10.110
what would remove the frictions

00:53:10.110 --> 00:53:12.210
for bringing the two groups together,

00:53:12.210 --> 00:53:17.210
but there's a pull side that is necessary

00:53:17.418 --> 00:53:20.280
for unlocking the friction side

00:53:20.280 --> 00:53:21.690
that we don't have a good bet for.

00:53:21.690 --> 00:53:23.640
Is that a reasonable two buckets

00:53:23.640 --> 00:53:26.250
or is there a third class

00:53:26.250 --> 00:53:28.210
of to-do agenda

00:53:30.510 --> 00:53:31.360
that I'm missing?

00:53:32.280 --> 00:53:34.023
- I do think that's fine, Jessica,

00:53:36.330 --> 00:53:37.620
- Anybody have anything to add?

00:53:37.620 --> 00:53:38.520
Tejal?

00:53:38.520 --> 00:53:40.923
Tony, you looked like
you were about to add.

00:53:44.693 --> 00:53:45.526
- I mean, I guess I'm not sure,

00:53:45.526 --> 00:53:47.210
tell me what you mean by a pull side.

00:53:48.058 --> 00:53:51.210
You mean a demand for better

