of demand that there is such a demand

00:54:23.310 --> 00:54:28.140
by society kind of can kind of really

00:54:28.140 --> 00:54:31.710
to give them actionable answers that work

00:54:31.710 --> 00:54:32.860
for different countries

00:54:35.392 --> 00:54:38.140
and that is the big kind of pool

00:54:39.170 --> 00:54:41.133
