00:54:42.159 --> 00:54:44.520
And I mean, and I think
that pool is really there

00:54:44.520 --> 00:54:46.263
and it's really kind of working.

00:54:49.600 --> 00:54:50.600
It's very protective

00:54:51.900 --> 00:54:56.550
and I think what can,

00:54:56.550 --> 00:54:58.050
Tesla has been saying it

00:54:58.050 --> 00:55:02.200
absolutely correct that I
would really love to see

00:55:03.849 --> 00:55:05.890
India produce its own IAMs

