00:55:23.220 --> 00:55:25.380
that they can really can bring to it

00:55:25.380 --> 00:55:28.200
and we have to be accepting
of their expertise,

00:55:28.200 --> 00:55:32.670
just like the expertise
of communities in Brazil.

00:55:32.670 --> 00:55:34.230
They have their own expertise

00:55:34.230 --> 00:55:37.030
and we have to be open to that

00:55:42.630 --> 00:55:44.103
inclusive to that,

00:55:45.733 --> 00:55:49.599
just to myself just have to be inclusive

00:55:49.599 --> 00:55:52.260
to the economist out there
that perhaps are be excluded

00:55:52.260 --> 00:55:53.403
by this conversation.

00:55:56.340 --> 00:55:59.430
- Including excluding
I think that there's,

00:55:59.430 --> 00:56:03.210
I mean there's clearly a
very large agenda to be,

00:56:03.210 --> 00:56:08.057
to both be articulated in
terms of what are the social,

00:56:09.210 --> 00:56:10.380
what are the questions

00:56:10.380 --> 00:56:12.540
that require an understanding
of both the human

00:56:12.540 --> 00:56:15.123
and social dynamics in order to make well.

00:56:16.596 --> 00:56:18.060
And there's an enormous set

00:56:18.060 --> 00:56:20.310
